  "label": "Paternity Metaphor",
  "description": "A rhetorical device used to imply a biological or familial relationship between two entities, often to suggest dependency, loyalty, or origin. In this meme, it is used derogatorily to suggest that Democrats are somehow 'children' or 'offspring' of Donald Trump, reducing complex political identities to a simplistic, familial relationship.",
